# Gitignored paths Claude Code copies from the main checkout into each
# worktree it creates. The main checkout's compiled deps and build let a
# new worktree's first `mix test` reuse them instead of compiling
# everything; scripts/auto-install.sh keeps them fresh on `main`. The copy
# leaves out symlinks, so .claude/hooks/setup-worktree.sh recreates
# _build/'s.
/deps/
/_build/
